{"en": "1438908431", "title": "Admin : Configurer la journalisation", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Administrateurs (profil technique)", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "En bref"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Modifier le niveau de journalisation du serveur en cours d'exécution et suivre le journal de l'application en direct, ce qui permet de diagnostiquer des problèmes sans redémarrer le serveur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un niveau de détail des journaux ajusté et une vue en direct du journal du serveur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Administrateurs, généralement le personnel technique. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur et peut être configuré par votre administrateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le nom du logger à cibler (par exemple, "}, {"type": "text", "text": "org.openelisglobal", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") et le niveau souhaité."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal → Administration → Configuration des journaux."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La configuration des journaux permet d'augmenter ou de réduire le niveau de journalisation d'un logger donné pendant l'exécution, puis de suivre le résultat dans le journal en direct. Il s'agit d'un outil de diagnostic : les modifications prennent effet immédiatement mais ne sont pas conservées après un redémarrage du serveur."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 1 : Définir le niveau de journalisation"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ouvrez le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Main Menu  ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "(menu principal), puis cliquez sur"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Administration.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 951, "alt": "Admin August.png", "id": "e6534df2-5ead-4e3f-a194-9167f9f51206", "collection": "contentId-1438908431", "type": "file", "height": 371}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur Administration", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Configuration des journaux", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Logging Configuration", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 958, "alt": "log conf.png", "id": "6c2b9a58-6851-44d9-8c91-4901780f6804", "collection": "contentId-1438908431", "type": "file", "height": 358}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur Configuration des journaux", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisissez un "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Niveau de journalisation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Log Level", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") (par exemple, INFO ou DEBUG) et saisissez le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Nom du logger", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Logger Name", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") (par exemple, "}, {"type": "text", "text": "org.openelisglobal", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "root", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Appliquer le niveau de journalisation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Apply Log Level", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 957, "alt": "apply log.png", "id": "6e29c5cf-52fc-45dd-98d1-77d5bd3e55b9", "collection": "contentId-1438908431", "type": "file", "height": 389}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration des journaux : les commandes de niveau de journalisation et de nom du logger au-dessus du journal de l'application en direct.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 2 : Suivre le journal en direct"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Activez l'interrupteur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Diffusion en direct", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Live stream", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") pour voir les lignes du journal s'afficher en temps réel."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 957, "alt": "apply log stream.png", "id": "3ad69824-3b9b-4cee-a043-b3b7d4eac5c4", "collection": "contentId-1438908431", "type": "file", "height": 389}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Activer l'interrupteur Diffusion en direct", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Utilisez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Effacer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Clear", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") pour vider l'affichage du journal à l'écran."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content"